    {"type":"text","id":"b1_b","x":100,"y":286,"width":260,"height":250,"text":"•  .mannostree.yml loader\n•  metadata engine (atomic)\n•  git engine (base · branch · wt)\n•  spawn / drop / list / info\n•  status / sync\n•  doctor / recover / clean\n•  node profile + env modes\n•  .task/ + RESULTS.md scaffold\n•  human + --json output\n\nOut-of-scope: parallel, agents, GitHub","originalText":"•  .mannostree.yml loader\n•  metadata engine (atomic)\n•  git engine (base · branch · wt)\n•  spawn / drop / list / info\n•  status / sync\n•  doctor / recover / clean\n•  node profile + env modes\n•  .task/ + RESULTS.md scaffold\n•  human + --json output\n\nOut-of-scope: parallel, agents, GitHub","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#fed7aa","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":44,"version":1,"versionNonce":45,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.55},

